5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must ensure the human element is secure. I shall look into staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. I want to see travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and national computing agreement and facility day rates.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll check accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and incident logs on shared instrumentation!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A wise start. I will examine station records from partner field sites and a portfolio review of schedule overruns.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I prefer the data of the past. I will review closeout files of finished awards and national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Does anyone else feel we are missing a piece of the puzzle?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,I think we have covered the basics of cost and capacity quite well.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to see what's happening at the facilities!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, do you think historical delivery is the best metric for future promise?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It is the only metric that does not rely on the applicant's optimism.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
